*50 [[Doge]]s spawn after 6 seconds<sup>180f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*3 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Metal Doge]]s spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 180 seconds<sup>5,400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Metal Doge]]s spawn after 180 seconds<sup>5,400f</sup>, delay 180 seconds<sup>5,400f</sup>.
