*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Sakura Android (Enemy)|Sakura Android]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns.
**Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 33.33~50 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,500f</sup>.
**Infinite [[H. Nah]]s spawn, delay 106.67 seconds<sup>3,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The Metal Doges in this stage come in packs of 3 at very long intervals, so as long as you have a reliant [[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|Critical Hitter]] you'll be fine. Sakura Android is much more powerful in this stage in addition to being supported by H. Nah, however, his long backswing still makes him vulnerable to quick attackers as well as long rangers like [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cyberpunk Cat]].

